{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51313","headline":"诗 · 戎昱","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒食涔阳诸小儿，齐歌齐舞带花枝。\n郡从兵乱年荒後，人似开元天宝时。\n（《舆地纪胜》引此四句後，注「云云」二字，复引「行春」二句。\n知原诗爲七律，引时删去第三联，今仅六句。\n此处分列，未允。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}